    "description": "Lumber camp (sawmill), level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. A miniature sawmill: a long open mill hall (dark oak frame on cobblestone feet, spruce roof with dark oak eaves and trim) with the saw bench in the middle, a sash-saw frame whose chain blade cuts the log on the carriage line; the grindstone (workstation) beside it. Log yard with piles and a pulley at the right end, plank yard at the left. L2 adds a waterwheel behind the hall driving the saw, a stonecutter, sawhorse, cart, lanterns, sign; L3 a drying rack, more logs, saplings, moss. Not yet builder-tested: moss_carpet, oak_sapling, stonecutter. Decoration step adds: item_frame, sign_text, water.",
